{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/205c4ce366beadfadd6f45186b8453d7.avif?t=1756615997\" width=550 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/304f59f5a9ce03be0062f9d87df5ee40.poster.avif?t=1756615997\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/304f59f5a9ce03be0062f9d87df5ee40.webm?t=1756615997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/304f59f5a9ce03be0062f9d87df5ee40.mp4?t=1756615997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you discover powerful equipment in the Unknown Lands, it will become available to you going forward. Mix and match equipment to find the playstyle that perfectly suits you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/d00bc1a807dd7fea3c2eceea8499ab6a.avif?t=1756615997\" width=550 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/99efaea9ba7b9633febdda4e654023b3.avif?t=1756615997\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Unknown Lands are vast, with many secret passages, hidden relics, and strange sights. Each run will unravel the world more and more, giving you a chance to make new discoveries each time.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/049ec2983ddecabbae30f21eccd7acfb.avif?t=1756615997\" width=550 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/3737b80a99fc8c05b68a723360a083f3.avif?t=1756615997\" width=600 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you make into the Unknown Lands will yield many powerful Runes. Use these to radically change and empower your equipment, making each run a unique experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Music: Thomas Bailey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instagram: delcroy</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219180?t=1756615997","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756615997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/5f2aa9face802fe09f3c4d3de15a09fc68f80e20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756615997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/5f2aa9face802fe09f3c4d3de15a09fc68f80e20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756615997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3853080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/205c4ce366beadfadd6f45186b8453d7.avif?t=1756615997\" width=550 height=95 /></span></p><p cla